                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I led a letter with my colleagues urging the USDA and HHS to evaluate and address the harmful impact potential cuts to Medicaid and SNAP could have on students\u2019 access to free and reduced-price school meals.\n\nWith food prices rising and school meal debt reaching crisis levels, ensuring children have access to nutritious meals must be a national priority\u2014not a point of debate.",
