                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "17 million Americans will lose their health insurance under Republicans\u2019 One Big Ugly Bill.\n\nThis reckless bill will devastate families\u2014forcing them to choose between medical care and putting food on the table.\n\nWe need everyone to stand up and vote NO.\n\nI'm fighting for you\u2014in Congress, in our communities, and in the courthouse. \n\nBecause your health, your dignity, and your future are worth it.",
