                "text": "Today is a sad day for all Americans. At a time when Americans are struggling with rising costs\u2014from healthcare to housing, groceries to childcare\u2014House Republicans have chosen to pass the most heartless bill of the 2lst century. https://t.co/Gm3ppdtTz3",
