                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Community care is vital for our veterans, but long-term stability demands bipartisan action.\n\u00a0\nWe need timely, accurate information to protect patients and ensure veterans can retire with dignity.\n\u00a0\nHomecare agencies are sounding the alarm about Medicaid cuts. The transition process must support patients at every step.",
