                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today marks 60 years of Medicare and Medicaid\u2014programs that are not a handout, but a lifeline for millions. These vital services protect our health, our dignity, and our future. \n\nWe must stand firm in defending them and ensure they continue to serve those who need them most, now and for generations to come.",
