                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This week, I visited Holy Cross New Family Health Center and spoke with frontline healthcare workers about the challenges and opportunities in Medicare and Medicaid.\n\nThese programs are vital to millions, and strengthening them means ensuring everyone has access to quality, affordable care when they need it most.\n\nHealthcare shouldn\u2019t be a privilege. You deserve better, and I\u2019m committed to making that a reality.",
