                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "On Monday, I held a Townhall with South Florida\u2019s medical community to discuss how Medicaid cuts impact patient care.\n\nThis was about listening to our seniors, veterans, working families, and everyone who has helped build this country.\n\nI\u2019m fighting to protect Medicaid, Food Assistance, and Social Security because these programs aren\u2019t just numbers in a budget, they\u2019re lifelines.\n\nYou\u2019ve paid in. You\u2019ve done everything right. You deserve to be rewarded, not punished.\n\nWe will not let cuts, red tape, or political games take away what you\u2019ve earned. \n\nTogether, we\u2019ll keep fighting for a stronger, fairer future.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1755041506,
                "view_count": 813
