                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Veterans deserve comprehensive healthcare, including full access to reproductive services.\n\nI\u2019m proud to stand in solidarity with my colleagues today in defense of reproductive freedom for our veterans.\n\nWe cannot allow a rollback of critical care and basic rights.\n\nNo exceptions.",
