                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We\u2019ve dedicated our lives to supporting our families, strengthening our communities, and building a better future. We all deserve to be treated with dignity and respect.\n\nJoin me this Sunday for an important conversation about protecting immigration, Food Assistance, and Medicaid to ensure the benefits and safety we\u2019ve earned are never taken away.\n\nWe deserve better, and together, we will make it happen.",
