                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We MUST prioritize preserving ACA tax credits and Medicaid, which provide critical healthcare access to thousands of families in our community. These programs are more than just policies, they are lifelines that keep people healthy, secure, and able to thrive.\n\nOur community deserves nothing less than leaders who fight to keep these lifelines intact.",
