                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This morning, I hosted a Townhall with Florida's 20th District. With Republicans threatening cuts to Medicaid, Social Security, and healthcare, our voices matter now more than ever.\n\nI'm fighting to protect your care and benefits because our dignity is not up for debate. Thank you for standing with me.",
