                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I stood proudly with my Democratic colleagues, fighting for those who depend on Affordable Care Act tax credits. \n\nHealthcare is not a privilege. It\u2019s a fundamental right, and we must defend it at all costs. Instead of slashing vital support, we must commit to expanding relief for those who need it most. \n\nThe time to act is now.",
